 "strings": {
  "Heh. I've been waitin' for this!": "",
  "Now we're talkin'.": "",
  "You deaf!? He said stop!": "",
  "I told you not another step!": "",
  "This is fucked up.": "",
  "Hey, something's not...": "",
  "How much you wanna bet\nthis is Kuroiwa's doing?": "",
  "Is this Kuroiwa's doing?": "",
  "Yeah... He did this.\nKilled them before they could kill him.": "",
  "He must have known\nthey'd come for him.": "",
  "Then where'd the bastard run off to?": "",
  "Where'd he go afterward, then?": "",
  "Sir, you can't—": "",
  "Hey, this isn't a—": "",
  "Let's all just play nice, okay?": "",
  "Whoa, whoa, whoa.": "",
  "Tell me, where did Kuroiwa go?": "",
  "Did Kuroiwa get away?": "",
  "That bastard...\nHe's on his way to the ADDC.": "",
  "He... headed for the ADDC...": "",
  "Probably gonna kill Shono.": "",
  "He's after Shono...": "",
  "Revenge for gettin' targeted.": "",
  "Probably wants revenge...": "",
  "He's gonna destroy AD-9...": "",
  "So he'll crush AD-9... ": "",
  "And ruin every last person...\nwho supported it.": "",
  "...And ruin anyone who touched it.": "",
  "Heh. So all the assholes are gonna\ntake each other out, huh? Not bad.": "",
  "So the scumbags take out\nthe scumbags? Fine by me.": "",
  "No...": "",
  "If Shono dies, it's done.\nThe whole case'll end up going cold.": "",
  "If Shono dies now,\nthe case'll go cold.": "",
  "And then we'll never be able\nto clear Okubo's name.": "",
  "We'll never clear\nOkubo's name like that.": "",
  "So let's go.": "",
  "We stay on Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Mafuyu. Can you send some officers\nto the ADDC?": "",
  "Hey, Mafuyu.\nCan you get the police to the ADDC?": "",
  "Shono's in danger.\nGet him somewhere safe.": "",
  "Shono's become a target.\nGet him somewhere safe.": "",
  "Man, this shit's a pain in the ass.": "",
  "This guy's a real\npain in the ass.": "",
  "Yeah. And keep an eye out for Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Yeah.\nTake Kuroiwa in if you find him.　": "",
  "He's getting desperate.": "",
  "He's armed and ready.": "",
  "I'm kinda wondering...\nThat asshole already here?": "",
  "Think Kuroiwa beat us here?": "",
  "What's going on?\nWhere's Kuroiwa?": "",
  "What's the situation?\nWhere's Kuroiwa?": "",
  "Please stop!": "",
  "Please, no further.": "",
  "It's okay, I'm a lawyer.\nIs Dr. Shono out of danger?": "",
  "I'm Yagami, an attorney.\nIs Shono somewhere safe?": "",
  "Uh... We're not really sure\nof the situation ourselves.": "",
  "No, we're still getting\na handle on this ourselves.": "",
  "Didn't somebody tell you\nwhat's going on here?": "",
  "Didn't you get orders\nfrom the top?": "",
  "We've got orders coming\nin from all sides...": "",
  "The orders are coming\nin from all sides...!": "",
  "I don't even know who's\nin charge here!": "",
  "It's a lot of conflicting information!": "",
  "Kuroiwa!": "",
  "You're Yagami, aren't you?": "",
  "Out of my way.": "",
  "Move!": "",
  "Not so fast.": "",
  "Don't be ridiculous.　": "",
  "We need to check your possessions.\nLift your arms up. Now.": "",
  "We're going to need to search you.\nArms in the air, please.　": "",
  "And why's that?\n\"Officer.\"": "",
  "What the hell!? Why!?": "",
  "To protect Dr. Shono\nfrom thugs like you. Now do it!": "",
  "It's for Dr. Shono's protection.\nArms up!": "",
  "Kuroiwa's the one\ngoing for Shono!": "",
  "Kuroiwa's the one targeting Shono!": "",
  "You can't let him get\naway with this!": "",
  "He's playing you!": "",
  "Why won't you listen to us!?\nKuroiwa's the one you want!": "",
  "Stop that guy!\nHe's after Shono!": "",
  "He's got a gun!": "",
  "He has a gun!": "",
  "We're done here!": "",
  "Cuff 'em!": "",
  "Kaito-san!\nKuroiwa's heading for the research wing.": "",
  "Kaito-san! Kuroiwa's heading\nfor the research wing. ": "",
  "We can't let him reach Shono's lab.": "",
  "He's going for Shono's lab.　": "",
  "Now let's go!": "",
  "We've gotta stop him!": "",
  "Heh. All right.": "",
  "Fine by me...": "",
  "If you say so!": "",
  "But I don't wanna\nhear about it later!": "",
  "Corner 'em!": "",
  "You little!": "",
  "Looks like we're all\ngettin' arrested today, huh?": "",
  "We're definitely going\nto jail for this one!": "",
  "Yagami-san, I'll see you in court!": "",
  "Yagami-san, you're my lawyer!": "",
  "C'mon, Tak.\nWe'll deal with him later!": "",
  "Tak, he'll have to wait!": "",
  "All right.": "",
  "Okay...　": "",
  "Looks like there's only\none way out of this, guys.": "",
  "Doesn't look like we\nhave much of a choice.": "",
  "Leave this to us. You go!": "",
  "Go on ahead, Tak.": "",
  "Just get a move on already.\nSugiura, too!": "",
  "Leave this to us.\nSugiura, go with him!": "",
  "Tak!\nGive that son of a bitch what for!": "",
  "Go!\nStopping Kuroiwa is on you!": "",
  "So you wanna fight, huh?": "",
  "We don't have much time.": "",
  "I don't have time for this bullshit!": "",
  "If you wanna stop me,\ncome and try!": "",
  "This is where Shono is, right?": "",
  "Is Shono on this floor?": "",
  "If he hasn't been evacuated.": "",
  "Assuming he hasn't bailed.": "",
  "His laboratory is just down this hallway.": "",
  "His lab should be\njust up ahead.": "",
  "Meaning Kuroiwa's waiting for us?": "",
  "Does that mean\nKuroiwa's nearby too?": "",
  "Probably.": "",
  "Yeah, probably.　": "",
  "Kuroiwa...": "",
  "You just can't help but get in my way...\nHuh, Yagami?": "",
  "You've been a thorn\nin my side, Yagami.": "",
  "Put the gun down. Getting revenge isn't\ngonna do you any good.": "",
  "Don't do this!\nWhat good is getting revenge now?": "",
  "You should recognize\nit's all over by now.": "",
  "Even killing Shono won't—": "",
  "Revenge?": "",
  "Hahahahaha...\nThat's not what I'm here for.": "",
  "Who said anything about that?": "",
  "This rat comes with me.": "",
  "I want him alive.": "",
  "Drop it!": "",
  "Drop the gun!": "",
  "Y-Yagami-san... ": "",
  "I think... he got me...": "",
  "He got me...": "",
  "Just hang in there.\nI'll make sure you get some help.": "",
  "Will you make it?\nI'll clear a path for help.": "",
  "And what about you?": "",
  "What about you?": "",
  "Me and Kuroiwa are gonna\nsettle this once and for all.": "",
  "Kuroiwa's going to pay for all this.": "",
  "That's fine.\nDon't try and rush, just...": "",
  "Then don't worry...\nTake your time.": "",
  "Hit him once for me... Yagami-san.": "",
  "Sock him a few times... for me.": "",
  "I will.": "",
  "We're here to rescue you, Shono.": "",
  "We came here to rescue you.": "",
  "Not that I want to.": "",
  "I'm not thrilled about it.": "",
  "Take care of him, okay?": "",
  "Make sure he stays with us.": "",
  "Yes. I can do that.": "",
  "Okay...": "",
  "Give it up.": "",
  "Give it up. ": "",
  "You're finished, Kuroiwa.": "",
  "It's all over.": "",
  "You're wrong!": "",
  "This isn't the end!": "",
  "Nothing's over yet!": "",
  "I have AD-9!": "",
  "I mean AD-9! ": "",
  "As long as it exists...\nI will never surrender.": "",
  "As long as it exists,\nI'm not done.": "",
  "Explain yourself.\nYou told me that you were gonna keep Shono alive?": "",
  "Is that why you said\nyou wanted Shono alive?": "",
  "Yeah. ": "",
  "Shono and I,\nwe're going to finish AD-9 together.": "",
  "We're going to bring\nAD-9 to fruition.": "",
  "I assure you he wants the same thing.": "",
  "I'm not alone on that.\nIt's what he wants too.": "",
  "That's how we'll be saved.\nBoth of us.": "",
  "It's the only way\nwe'll ever be saved.": "",
  "You really so sure you can accomplish that?": "",
  "You really think\nit can be done?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm sure of it!": "",
  "It's so close!": "",
  "I'll show you...": "",
  "I'll prove it.": "",
  "Just you wait.": "",
  "We're going to finish. No matter how many\ntest subjects it takes us to complete it.": "",
  "I'll get us as many\ntest subjects as it needs.": "",
  "As long as we complete the cure...\nShono and I... We'll be praised as heroes!": "",
  "If we finish it, we'll not only avoid jail...\nThe world will sing our praises!": "",
  "You're insane.": "",
  "Hmph. In that case...": "",
  "In that case...": "",
  "You can be our first\nsubject in a long while.": "",
  "We can resume testing on you.": "",
  "And when you die,\nwhich of course you will...": "",
  "And when you're dead,\nyou can join the others...": "",
  "I'll gouge out your eyes!": "",
  "With your eyes gouged out!": "",
  "Look who went and made a new friend.": "",
  "We've come to an\nunderstanding of sorts.": "",
  "They, uh... agreed not to put us\nbehind bars, at least for now.": "",
  "We're not under arrest\nquite yet, but...": "",
  "But we're gonna need a lawyer though.": "",
  "We're gonna need a lawyer soon.": "",
  "Shono?": "",
  "Don't move! Drop the knife!": "",
  "Stop! Stop right there!": "",
  "Just tellin' him to stop's\nnot gonna do shit.": "",
  "You thought he'd stop\n'cause you asked nice?": "",
  "Shonooo!": "",
  "Damn you!": "",
  "Your little...\nexperiment game...": "",
  "Your little... science games...": "",
  "...is finally... over...": "",
  "Are over now.": "",
  "Yes.\nBut I have no need for them anymore.": "",
  "No...\nI've hit a turning point.": "",
  "What's that?": "",
  "Is that...?": "",
  "This?": "",
  "It's a dose of AD-9.": "",
  "It's AD-9.": "",
  "You see?\nI finally did it.": "",
  "Don't die just yet.": "",
  "What are you doing?": "",
  "AD-9 is done now.": "",
  "I finished it...": "",
  "Everything I have has gone\ninto this one syringe.": "",
  "I gave it everything\nI have to give...": "",
  "There's no mistaking it this time.": "",
  "No mistakes this time...!": "",
  "Here's the proof.": "",
  "Here at the end...": "",
  "I'm going to show you\nonce and for all.": "",
  "My miracle drug is finished...": "",
  "I'll prove that my miracle drug\nis a reality!": "",
  "And I'll prove it!": "",
  "How many people has your \"miracle\" killed?": "",
  "How many people have\ndied from that?": "",
  "People...": "",
  "People? But it'll save millions!\nMaybe tens of millions across the world!": "",
  "But it's going to save millions!\nNo, tens of millions of people!": "",
  "That's why you thought it was okay\nto murder an innocent woman? Huh?": "",
  "And that's why you killed\nan innocent woman? Hm?": "",
  "Is that why you stabbed her\nto death and burned the evidence!?": ""
 },
